1
00:00:00,101 --> 00:00:01,121
(Sheldon:)I'm not okay.

2
00:00:02,236 --> 00:00:04,436
(Leonard:)Get up. We can't...
We can't lose in math!

3
00:00:04,639 --> 00:00:05,799
- Thirty-seven!
- Yes!

4
00:00:08,509 --> 00:00:09,839
(Amy:)Ready, set, wrestle.

5
00:00:11,979 --> 00:00:13,809
(Amy:)One, two, three, pin.

6
00:00:14,548 --> 00:00:16,038
(Penny:)Mwah.

7
00:00:16,918 --> 00:00:19,178
(Sheldon:)- Stop that.
- Mwah.

8
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:21,053
- Amy, do something.
- Mwah.

9
00:00:21,222 --> 00:00:22,412
(Sheldon:)Amy. Help.

10
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,920
Wha...? Amy, stop that.

11
00:00:25,092 --> 00:00:27,292
(Sheldon:)Amy, Penny.
Both of you, stop it.

12
00:00:31,432 --> 00:00:33,022
(Howard:)One to beam aboard?

13
00:00:33,267 --> 00:00:35,027
(Raj:)Oh, my God, you're back.

14
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:39,170
(Raj:)Oh, look at you.
You... You look like you grew.

15
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,370
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

16
00:00:42,243 --> 00:00:46,683
(Howard:)The lack of gravity did decompress my
spine, so I'm, like, an inch-and-a-half taller.

17
00:00:47,982 --> 00:00:51,972
I'm going to the DMVtomorrow to get
my license changed before I shrink back.

18
00:00:52,186 --> 00:00:56,486
Come in, come in. I didn't think I was
gonna get to see you until tomorrow.

